<title>USA: TABLE-Burnham Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Burnham Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos    3 Mos     6 Mos    6 Mos</p>
<p>				     1997     1996	1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    $35,475  $34,458   $66,769  $64,770</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold	  26,266   26,098    49,229   48,977</p>
<p>				    9,209    8,450    17,540   15,793</p>
<p> SG&amp;A expenses		  7,516    6,880    14,599   13,349</p>
<p> Income before income taxes 1,693    1,570     2,941    2,444</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes   660	597     1,147	929</p>
<p> Net income for period	1,033	973     1,794    1,515</p>
<p> Net earnings per share	0.46     0.43	0.80     0.67</p>
<p>(In thousands of dollars, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
